    <node id="&quot;NIGEL HARRIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nigel Harris is a British actor born in 1949, with a background in philosophy and drama teaching. He is the son of philosopher Errol Harris and the grandson of Samuel Harris, a defender of Kimberly during the Boer War. He studied at the University of Nottingham and was involved in student affairs."|</data>
